"Voleeo" is referenced only to describe this origin and the Voleeo workspace /
bundle formats Yuki can import. Yuki is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
Voleeo project.

Third-party components
----------------------
Yuki links crates from crates.io (including GPUI and GPUI Kit, Apache-2.0) and
embeds Lucide icons (ISC) through gpui-kit-assets. Each keeps its own license
(MIT, Apache-2.0, ISC, BSD-2/3-Clause, Zlib, Unicode-3.0, MPL-2.0, CC0, ...).
Binary distributions must ship those license texts, e.g. generated with
`cargo about generate`.

vendor/gpui-base is gpui-base 0.7.1 (https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit,
Apache-2.0, license text in vendor/gpui-base/LICENSE-APACHE), modified to show
inline tokens in its code editor; each change is marked `yuki:`.
